		}
		note {
			text """
Comments on "Family History Library" REPOSITORY Record.

This record uses all possible GEDCOM tags for a REPOSITORY record. Some things to look for are:

1. The address is specified twice. Once in a multi-line address record and once in separate lines. The first method is usually enough. The second method is to be more specific about parts of the address. Is everything imported?

2. There are multiple phone numbers. Are they all imported?"""
			audit.creation.date 2000-03-12T11:44:05Z
		}
		audit.creation.date 2000-03-12T10:36:02Z
	}

