			text """
Comments on "Lucy Special ANSEL" INDIVIDUAL Record.

The following are the special characters supported by the ANSEL character set. The first two letters are the Hex code. The following text describes the character. Finally, that character, or a character as close as possible to that character, should appear in the parentheses.

A1 slash l - uppercase (�)
A2 slash o - uppercase (�)
A3 slash d - uppercase (�)
A4 thorn - uppercase (�)
A5 ligature ae - uppercase (�)
A6 ligature oe - uppercase (�)
A7 single prime (�)
A8 middle dot (�)
A9 musical flat (�)
AA registered sign (�)
AB plus-or-minus (�)
AC hook o - uppercase (�)
AD hook u - uppercase (�)
AE left half ring (�)
BO right half ring (�)
B1 slash l - lowercase (�)
B2 slash o - lowercase (�)
B3 slash d - lowercase (�)
B4 thorn - lowercase (�)
B5 ligature ae - lowercase (�)
B6 ligature oe - lowercase (�)
B7 double prime (�)
B8 dotless i - lowercase (�)
B9 british pound (�)
BA eth (�)
BC hook o - lowercase (�)
BD hook u - lowercase (�)
BE empty box - LDS extension (�)
BF black box - LDS extensions (�)
CO degree sign (�)
C1 script l (�)
C2 phonograph copyright mark (�)
C3 copyright symbol (�)
C4 musical sharp (�)
C5 inverted question mark (�)
C6 inverted exclamation mark (�)
CD midline e - LDS extension (�)
CE midline o - LDS extension (�)
CF es zet (�)"""
			audit.creation.date 2000-06-13T16:28:45Z
		}
		audit.creation.date 2001-01-11T16:00:23Z
	}

